{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23301","headline":"与诸客携酒寻去年梅花有感 · 白居易","name":"与诸客携酒寻去年梅花有感","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"马上同携今日杯，湖边共觅去春梅。\n年年只是人空老，处处何曾花不开。\n诗思又牵吟咏发，酒酣闲唤管弦来。\n樽前百事皆依旧，点检惟无薛秀才。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23301.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23301","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}